A one man army.

2
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:26,000
Wrath of Man is a thriller, crime, drama film directed by Guy Ritchie.

3
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:06,000
A cold and mysterious new security guard for a Los Angeles cash truck company
surprises his co-workers when he unleashes precision skills during a heist.

4
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:46,000
The crew is left wondering who he is and where he came from.

5
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:26,000
Soon, the marksman's ultimate motive becomes clear as he takes
dramatic and irrevocable steps to settle a score.

6
00:34:00,000 --> 00:34:06,000
H, played by Jason Statham.

7
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:46,000
Bullet, played by Holt McCallany.

8
00:45:20,000 --> 00:45:26,000
Hollow Bob, played by Rocci Williams.

9
00:51:00,000 --> 00:51:06,000
Boy Sweat Dave, played by Josh Hartnett.

10
00:56:40,000 --> 00:56:46,000
Jackson, played by Jeffrey Donovan.

11
01:02:20,000 --> 01:02:26,000
Jan, played by Scott Eastwood.

12
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
Wrath of Man is a 2021 action thriller film directed by Guy Ritchie,
who co-wrote it with Ivan Atkinson and Marn Davies.

13
01:13:40,000 --> 01:13:46,000
It is loosely based on the 2004 French film Cash Truck.

14
01:19:20,000 --> 01:19:26,000
It is Ritchie's fourth directorial collaboration with lead actor
Jason Statham, and the first since Revolver (2005).

15
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
Holt McCallany, Jeffrey Donovan, Chris Reilly, Josh Hartnett, Laz Alonso, Raúl Castillo,
DeObia Oparei, Eddie Marsan, and Scott Eastwood appear in supporting roles.

16
01:30:40,000 --> 01:30:46,000
In the film, H (Statham) is a new cash-truck driver in Los Angeles, whose thwarting of a
robbery leads to his skillset with guns and mysterious past being questioned.

17
01:36:20,000 --> 01:36:26,000
Wrath of Man was released in several countries on April 22,
2021, and in the United States on May 7.

18
01:42:00,000 --> 01:42:06,000
Despite receiving mixed reviews from critics, the
film grossed $104 million worldwide.

19
01:47:40,000 --> 01:47:46,000
The film explores themes of robbery, affectation, crime boss, revenge, shootout.

20
01:53:20,000 --> 01:53:26,000
The tone is emotional and intense.
